# tests/lang/140_font.tr
# std.font: sfnt parsing (TrueType, CFF-based OpenType, WOFF), cmap, metrics,
# kerning and ligatures, shaping, outlines, rasterizing, line breaking,
# subsetting, damaged-font robustness; and Unicode text in std.encoding.pdf
# (embedded CIDFontType2 subsets, ToUnicode, widths).
# The two small fonts are subsets of DejaVu Sans (glyf, GPOS kern, GSUB liga)
# and URW Nimbus Sans (CFF, GPOS kern, GSUB liga) made with fontTools; the
# expected metrics were read back with fontTools and rasterizer coverage was
# compared with Pillow (within 5%). The WOFF is the TrueType subset
# re-wrapped with zlib-compressed tables.

